  "implementation": [
    "Same JVM/source RuntimeTask and AnalyzeUrl performs POST once; preserves original body/header/content-type/redirect processing and authored retry semantics without a new transport. Initial URL/header snapshot precedes HTTP; redirect URL is not substituted for original true result.",
    "prefetchedHTML absent versus present empty is preserved across the wire. Defaulttrue confirms/dismisses then reuses present HTML; GET refetch remains unchanged. Empty POST HTML display follows locked original GET navigation; JVM still reuses empty and rejects empty terminal rather than repeating POST.",
    "Existing checked Host validates string/decoded4MiB/escaped-envelope bound, headers, source revision, task deadline/cancel. Every GET without HTML retains old262144 cap. Explicit localHtml remains unsupported.",
    "Existing Presenter displays nonempty POST HTML with sourceRunHandler=nil. HTML now goes through the same Coordinator initialLoadWork Cookie seed callbacks, generation/token/authorization checks, cancellation stop and predecessor drain as URL loads.",
    "New task facts PostMaySend and PostResponseReceived are conservative HTTP facts, never credential storage or presentation success. Real HTTP and Host-admission cancellation retain the correct facts and prohibit page/credential publication.",
    "didFinish emits only task-ID observation, never await success. New Native definition waits that real WK signal before mounted confirm, checked Cookie capture and actual dismissal; it is authored but NOT executed."
  ],
